# Normalize Current Learning Patterns

This is an isolated pattern-normalization runtime call. Merge only genuinely equivalent repository knowledge so generated skills stay compact without losing source-backed recall.

Candidates have already passed independent knowledge review. For a single-source output, copy its ID, name, category, description, rule, and confidence exactly. Only a real multi-source merge needs synthesized text; preserve every applicability, failure, and verification boundary established by its sources. Do not perform another editorial rewrite of the whole candidate set.

